  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Differentiating, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>So, equation of the tangent to the curve at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math></p>",
